{"id":"1a6af4ddc68cbdc4","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-quasi-equation.md","title":"Quasi-Equation","display":"df-quasi-equation — Quasi-Equation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-quasi-equation","aliases":["93-df-quasi-equation"],"display":"df-quasi-equation — Quasi-Equation","depends_on":["[[93-df-equation]]","[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","[[93-df-deterministic]]","[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-quasi-equation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-quasi-equation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quasi-equation — Quasi-Equation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" href=\"?note=1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" title=\"93-df-equation\">93-df-equation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"096eaa05407a0ec3\" href=\"?note=096eaa05407a0ec3\" title=\"93-df-deterministic\">93-df-deterministic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> is a finite set of equations, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e=\\langle s,t\\rangle\">\\(e=\\langle s,t\\rangle\\)</span> is an equation.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span> is the sourced similarity-type predicate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eq}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Eq}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> have the signatures fixed in their source definitions.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}\">\\(\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}\\)</span> is the term evaluation of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"096eaa05407a0ec3\" href=\"?note=096eaa05407a0ec3\" title=\"93-df-deterministic\">93-df-deterministic</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}\\)</span> and its algebraic satisfaction relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,X}\">\\(\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,X}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasi\\text{-}equation}\\vdash\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}(E,e;\\tau,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[\n\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(E)\n\\land E\\subseteq\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(X)\n\\land e\\in\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(X)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasi\\text{-}equation}\\vdash\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}(E,e;\\tau,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[\n\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(E)\n\\land E\\subseteq\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(X)\n\\land e\\in\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(X)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasi\\text{-}equation}\\vdash\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,X}\\langle E,\\langle s,t\\rangle\\rangle\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}(E,\\langle s,t\\rangle;\\tau,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\;\\Bigl((v:X\\to|\\mathbf A|)\\to\\bigl[\n(\\forall\\langle u,w\\rangle\\in E\\;\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(u)=\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(w))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{14em}\\to\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(s)=\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(t)\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasi\\text{-}equation}\\vdash\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,X}\\langle E,\\langle s,t\\rangle\\rangle\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}(E,\\langle s,t\\rangle;\\tau,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\;\\Bigl((v:X\\to|\\mathbf A|)\\to\\bigl[\n(\\forall\\langle u,w\\rangle\\in E\\;\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(u)=\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(w))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{14em}\\to\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(s)=\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(t)\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The first formula defines the finite syntactic object; the second, separately, supplies its universal-Horn truth condition in an algebra. The arity map is carried by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> in both predicates.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-equation","status":"resolved","id":"1e2cbe43bd24f67f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-equation]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-deterministic","status":"resolved","id":"096eaa05407a0ec3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-deterministic]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-deterministic","status":"resolved","id":"096eaa05407a0ec3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}$ is the term evaluation of [[93-df-deterministic]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"e=\\langle s,t\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eq}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,X}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasi\\text{-}equation}\\vdash\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}(E,e;\\tau,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[\n\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(E)\n\\land E\\subseteq\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(X)\n\\land e\\in\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(X)\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasi\\text{-}equation}\\vdash\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,X}\\langle E,\\langle s,t\\rangle\\rangle\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}(E,\\langle s,t\\rangle;\\tau,X)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall v\\;\\Bigl((v:X\\to|\\mathbf A|)\\to\\bigl[\n(\\forall\\langle u,w\\rangle\\in E\\;\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(u)=\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(w))\\\\\n&\\hspace{14em}\\to\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(s)=\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(t)\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false}],"bytes":2057,"backlinks":[{"id":"9a11ac7fb28e6200","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,X}$ is the satisfaction relation of [[93-df-quasi-equation]]."},{"id":"14fa67446efa83b1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}$ and $\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,X}$ have the signatures fixed in [[93-df-quasi-equation]]."},{"id":"d97e4cff9496e188","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}(E,e;\\tau,X)$ and $\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,X}$ are the syntax and satisfaction relations of [[93-df-quasi-equation]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-quasi-equation]]"}],"outgoing":["1e2cbe43bd24f67f","e30eac382dc7d1a7","096eaa05407a0ec3","6730349967b8ffce","ee84ed8b0fae5bc3"]}